OL,3,GNEWSADo the Shetland Isles need Cold
OL,4,AWar-style military protection?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCalls are being made for the defence of
OL,7,Fthe Shetland Isles to be strengthened
OL,8,Fafter increased sightings of Russian
OL,9,Ftrawlers off the coast of Scotland.
OL,11,FRecent analysis by the Daily Telegraph
OL,12,Falso revealed that there have been more
OL,13,Fthan 500 incidents where Russian boats
OL,14,Fhave been stationed above undersea
OL,15,Fcables linking Britain with Europe and
OL,16,Fthe US.
OL,18,FThese cables carry the majority of
OL,19,Ftelecoms data abroad.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
