OL,3,GNEWSADo the Shetland Isles need Cold
OL,4,AWar-style military protection?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe growing importance of undersea
OL,7,Finfrastructure prompted a parliamentary
OL,8,Freport last year to warn of security
OL,9,Fvulnerabilities in areas including
OL,10,Ftransport and supply chains, financial
OL,11,Fservices and payment systems.
